# Allowlist: deny everything, then permit only what the Dockerfile COPYs, so
# pod.env, state files and docs never enter the image. Add an !allow line for
# every new COPY.
*

!Dockerfile
!build_assets/
!start.sh

# Re-exclude junk even inside allowed dirs.
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
**/__pycache__
**/README.md
